Accountable (A): B2B Sourcing Quality Inspector
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5243_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5243_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
