    <bpmn:process id="W_W5244" name="W5244. Materials Discrepancy Damage Claims and Transit Insurance Execution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Signed JQS statement (W5243) showing damage or shortage
Frequency: Ad-hoc per discrepancy incident
Volume: ~5-10 claims filed annually
